+/// The species for grid rows 0..4, top row first (and toughest). Six themes
+/// and twelve scenes share a factor, so themes repeat every six levels while
+/// the backdrop repeats every twelve: level 7 wears theme 0 against a
+/// different sky, and no two of the twelve look alike.
+static const int32 kThemes[6][5] = {
+	{ 5, 1, 0, 0, 2 },			// classic: hornet moth grunt grunt beetle
+	{ 5, 8, 1, 2, 0 },			// + ray:   hornet stingray moth beetle grunt
+	{ 9, 6, 8, 7, 4 },			// new-heavy
